2 QUAY 3
1 NOTE <p>His birthdate is estimated.</p><p>In the "Lidmatenboek" of "the waere christlijke gemeinte van Vlachtwedde" the reverend Henricus Hommerikhuizen noted on 28 february 1696 the name of Dietert Tammes
2 CONC  as "lidmaat nr. 316" of this church.</p>On 19 september 1707 Harm Hesselinck, married to Annecke Harmens, living in the Luchtenborgh in Veele, sell to Lucas Hazelhoff, 'erggesetene in Blijham:  a cer
2 CONC tain house and garden in Veele, used in rent bij Dietert Tammes, for the sum of 300 Carolus guilders.
